-   To maintain In-Bond, Ex-Bond & UP statement with Custom-Bond Register;

-   Prepare yearly Import and Export Customs statement for Bond Audit;

-   Submission utilizations declarations (UD/amendment) for raw materials, chemical on online and arrange to get final approval on time from BGMEA;

